{"availability":"available","full":"chrisqtruong/bankrolled","name":"bankrolled","description":"A daily, sourced record of the money behind American sports betting, maintained by Chris Truong. Plain HTML/CSS/JS with hand-drawn SVG charts on GitHub Pages, giscus comments, and research updates every 2 hours by Claude.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T02:03:21Z","updated":"2026-10-08T04:24:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chrisqtruong.github.io/bankrolled/","topics":["accountability","claude","data-journalism","giscus","github-pages","javascript","sports-betting"],"demo":"https://chrisqtruong.github.io/bankrolled/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.893Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.893Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.893Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.893Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A daily, sourced record of the money behind American gambling, from sportsbooks to prediction markets: who pays whom, who loses, and who writes the rules.","Powerful institutions count on the public record being scattered and easy to forget. Bankrolled uses AI for public good: it gathers what is already public, checks it against primary sources, and keeps it in one searchable, permanent, freely reusable place. Sports gambling, from sportsbooks to prediction markets, is the first subject. The method (sourced facts, honest labels, nothing deleted) is intended to extend to other matters of public concern, such as money in politics, corruption, corporate conduct, environmental harm and the documentation of abuses."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chrisqtruong/bankrolled/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3ad0f3b1fbd8828e90f502a66998b4028e8d739b127fc737d4d11f09dc54a31c","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:09.029Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:09.029Z","projectInsights":{"v